==Battleground==
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPIs]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Easy stage, even [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] can beat it.

